"""
foamFO - Browse, search and generate OpenFOAM function object entries.

The database is built by parsing the doxygen header comments
(Description / Usage / \\verbatim / \\table sections) of the OpenFOAM
sources, plus the tutorials and the etc/caseDicts/postProcessing templates.

Sub-commands:
    build     Scan the sources and write the database
    list      List function objects (optionally by group)
    search    Full-text search in names and descriptions
    show      Show description, example, parameters and references
    example   Print real usage blocks taken from the tutorials
    add       Write a ready-to-edit entry into <case>/system
    html      Generate the stand-alone catalog.html

Database lookup order:
    1. $FOAMFO_DB
    2. ${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/foamFO/foDatabase-<version>.json,
       where <version> is the basename of $WM_PROJECT_DIR (written by 'build')
    3. foDatabase.json bundled next to this script
"""

